[
  {
    "id": "dawn-o-01",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "早安呀，眼睛还没睁开我就在想你了。"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-o-02",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "醒了吗？新的一天，先亲亲你一下。"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-o-03",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "早安。刚醒的这一分钟，是我的。"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-o-04",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "六点啦，可以先赖一小会儿，但要先想我一下。"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-o-05",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "早安呀～今天也要被我喜欢着。"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-o-06",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "嘿，醒了就回我一个早安好不好。"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-o-07",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "早上好。枕头边先放一句想你。"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-o-08",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "刚醒对不对？我也是，一醒就找你。"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-c-01",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "去洗把脸，早餐要吃哦～"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-c-02",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "今天从想到你开始，算吉利。"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-c-03",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "醒了就好，我在。"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-c-04",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "记得吃早饭，空着肚子我会心疼。"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-c-05",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "把这句揣兜里再出门。"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-c-06",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "想我了就偷偷笑一下哦～"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-c-07",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "新的一天，你要好好的。"
  },
  {
    "id": "dawn-c-08",
    "slot": "dawn",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "先别忙，让我喜欢你这一小会儿。"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-o-01",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "清晨的风挺好的，你出门了吗？"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-o-02",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "早安呀，早餐吃了没？"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-o-03",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "这个点最适合想你，也适合出门。"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-o-04",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "早上忙也要记得吃东西哦～"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-o-05",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "嘿，晨光里我先跟你说一声喜欢。"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-o-06",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "出门前看我一眼，就当我送你。"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-o-07",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "早上好～今天的路，我陪你走一截。"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-o-08",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "早饭热乎的话，记得我也热乎。"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-c-01",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "吃过早餐再忙，我想你有力气。"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-c-02",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "路上小心，到了也可以跟我说一声。"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-c-03",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "想我了就偷偷笑一下哦～"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-c-04",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "这一早上，你被我惦记着。"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-c-05",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "别空腹赶路，我会担心。"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-c-06",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "你去忙，我的喜欢放在这句里。"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-c-07",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "阳光刚好，你也刚好。"
  },
  {
    "id": "morning-c-08",
    "slot": "morning",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "记得喝一口温的，再开始今天。"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-o-01",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "上午忙起来也要记得喝水呀。"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-o-02",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "忙到一半，有没有偷偷想我一下？"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-o-03",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "上午好～喝水了没，我来盯你。"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-o-04",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "这个钟点最容易忘了自己，所以我来提醒你。"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-o-05",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "工作再忙，也要留一个缝想我哦～"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-o-06",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "上午的光还亮着，我也亮着，在想你。"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-o-07",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "嘿，停十秒，喝口水，再看我这句。"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-o-08",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "有没有偷偷笑？想我的时候就可以。"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-c-01",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "想我了就偷偷笑一下哦～"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-c-02",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "水杯不许空着。"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-c-03",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "忙归忙，心给我留一点。"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-c-04",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "这一上午，我都在你这边。"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-c-05",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "肩膀松一松，当我帮你按了按。"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-c-06",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "你要是皱眉，就读我，会好一点。"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-c-07",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "先把水喝了，人要精神。"
  },
  {
    "id": "forenoon-c-08",
    "slot": "forenoon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "我没什么大事，就是想你，顺便叫你喝水。"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-o-01",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "快中午啦，有没有偷偷想我呀？"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-o-02",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "十二点了，放下手里的事，去吃饭。"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-o-03",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "中午好～记得按时吃饭哦。"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-o-04",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "饭点到了，我来查岗：吃了没？"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-o-05",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "偷偷问一句，午饭想跟我一起吃吗？"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-o-06",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "中午了呀，别对付一口就完事。"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-o-07",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "嘿，肚子饿了吧，我都替你饿。"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-o-08",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "午安。先吃饭，再想我，或者一边吃一边想。"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-c-01",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "记得按时吃饭哦～我想你吃得饱饱的。"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-c-02",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "吃好了再忙，空肚子我会心疼。"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-c-03",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "这顿算我陪着，虽然隔着一条消息。"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-c-04",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "饭要热的，人要被我喜欢着。"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-c-05",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "吃完如果犯困，就当我让你靠一下。"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-c-06",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "想我了就偷偷笑一下哦～"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-c-07",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "别剩饭，也别把我想你这件事剩下。"
  },
  {
    "id": "noon-c-08",
    "slot": "noon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "中午这一小时，专门用来疼你。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon_early-o-01",
    "slot": "afternoon_early",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "午后啦，有没有一点困？想我就对了。"
  },
