    "id": "afternoon_early-o-02",
    "slot": "afternoon_early",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "吃过午饭了吧？没有的话现在去。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon_early-o-03",
    "slot": "afternoon_early",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "这个点最容易累，我来陪你缓一缓。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon_early-o-04",
    "slot": "afternoon_early",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "午后好～偷偷想我了没有？"
  },
