    "id": "afternoon_early-o-07",
    "slot": "afternoon_early",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "嘿，犯困就正常，别硬撑。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon_early-o-08",
    "slot": "afternoon_early",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "有没有喝水？午后也要喝哦～"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon_early-c-01",
    "slot": "afternoon_early",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "靠一靠，我的喜欢不急。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon_early-c-02",
    "slot": "afternoon_early",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "想我了就偷偷笑一下哦～"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon_early-c-03",
    "slot": "afternoon_early",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "困了就眯五分钟，我守着。"
  },
