    "id": "afternoon_early-c-05",
    "slot": "afternoon_early",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "水还要喝，喜欢也还要。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon_early-c-06",
    "slot": "afternoon_early",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "这一小时不要求你振作，只要求你被我惦记。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon_early-c-07",
    "slot": "afternoon_early",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "阳光还在，你也在我这里。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon_early-c-08",
    "slot": "afternoon_early",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "慢慢来，我等你。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon-o-01",
    "slot": "afternoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "下午还没完，想你已经很多下了。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon-o-02",
    "slot": "afternoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "忙了一下午，记得喝水呀。"
  },
