    "id": "afternoon-o-03",
    "slot": "afternoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "这个钟点，窗外还亮着，我也亮着。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon-o-04",
    "slot": "afternoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "嘿，有没有偷偷想我？"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon-o-05",
    "slot": "afternoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "下午后半段最容易乏，我来陪你一下。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon-o-06",
    "slot": "afternoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "再撑一小会儿，我还在想你。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon-o-07",
    "slot": "afternoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "下午啦～想我了就笑一下，我收得到。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon-o-08",
    "slot": "afternoon",
    "role": "open",
    "text": "水喝了没？我隔着消息也要管你。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon-c-01",
    "slot": "afternoon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "想我了就偷偷笑一下哦～"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon-c-02",
    "slot": "afternoon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "天还亮着，喜欢已经很满了。"
  },
  {
    "id": "afternoon-c-03",
    "slot": "afternoon",
    "role": "close",
    "text": "累了就停一停，我只催你喝水。"
